              <div class="of-ftype__faq-item"><button class="of-ftype__faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What classroom materials does UV film protect?<span class="of-ftype__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><div class="of-ftype__faq-a" hidden>UV film helps protect student artwork, educational posters, cork boards, carpeting, upholstered furniture, library materials, and other interior finishes exposed to daylight through untreated glass.</div></div>
